          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The datasets present the following information: Semantic prosody, MIC c-collocation, MIC c-collocation in the texts, Newspaper, Period, Date, Title, Explanation, Surrounding co-texts.\n\nAbbreviations:\nMIC: made in China,\nCD: China Daily,\nSCMP: South China Morning Post,\nGT: Global Times, \nXH: Xinhua Financial Agency,\nSD: Shenzhen Daily,\nCP: The China Post, \nNYT: The New York Times,\nWSJ: The Wall Street Journal,\nWP: The Washington Post,\nUSA-T: USA Today."
